                                                "sense_id": "1b80176e-eda1-3e6d-8dae-590d906818bb",
                                                "text": "Finally, if muriquis are strongly folivorous, they should conserve energy expenditure by using a relatively small area with just enough leaf sources to meet their nutritional needs, and devote a large proportion of their day to resting."
